{
  "_readme": [
    "Reconciliation ledger for verify:pack-drift. Each entry is the sha256 (16 hex) of the",
    "packed file and of its live counterpart AS THEY STOOD when a human last compared them.",
    "The two sides are genericized copies, never byte-identical, so equality is not the",
    "contract — reconciliation is: either side moving fails the check until someone opens the",
    "counterpart, ports what belongs there, and re-runs with --reconcile. Add a \"note\" to any",
    "pair to record why it diverges; notes and this _readme survive a reconcile."
  ],
